<title>USA: Negotiated muni sales to total $392 mln Sept 17.</title>
<headline>Negotiated muni sales to total $392 mln Sept 17.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled negotiated municipal bond sales are expected to total $392 million in 12 offerings for Tuesday, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>The largest issue is expected to be a $195 million Georgia Municipal Electric Authority deal via JP Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>An additional $105 million of deals are on the Reuters possible negotiated calendar, meaning underwriters have said they may decide to price the issues Tuesday depending on market conditions.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Information Group, 212-859-1826</p>
</text>
